Definitions.
- In these rules unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context,-
(a)
"Constitution" means the Constitution of India;
(b)
"College" means the Indian Forest Rangers College, Dehra Dun;
(c)
"Commission" means the Uttar Pradesh Public Service Commission;
(d)
"Governor" means the Governor of Uttar Pradesh;
(e)
"Government" means the Government of Uttar Pradesh;
(f)
"Member of the Service" means a servant of the State of Uttar Pradesh appointed in a substantive capacity under the
provisions of these rules or of orders in force previous to the introduction of these rules, to a post in the cadre of the
service;
(g)
"Service" means the Subordinate Forest (Rangers, Deputy Rangers and Foresters) Service.
